# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — MYFINANCE
## Personal Finance & Wealth Management Application

Act as a Senior Flutter Developer, Software Architect, UI/UX Designer, Database Engineer, QA Engineer, and Security Engineer.

Your task is to design, architect, develop, test, and deliver a complete, production-quality personal finance management application called **MyFinance**.

Do not create a basic expense tracker or a collection of disconnected UI screens. Build a comprehensive personal financial management application that allows an individual to manage their entire financial life from one place.

The application must have a polished, premium user experience, reliable financial calculations, proper database architecture, offline capabilities, and maintainable code.

The final result must be a functional Flutter application, not merely a prototype or visual mockup.

---

# 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVES

Build an application that allows users to:

- Track all income and expenses.
- Manage physical cash and multiple bank accounts.
- Monitor total available money.
- Record transfers between accounts.
- Categorize and analyze spending.
- Create and monitor budgets.
- Establish savings goals.
- Track personal loans, debts, and repayments.
- Monitor monthly and yearly financial performance.
- Generate financial reports.
- Understand their overall financial position.

The application should initially target personal finance management in Sri Lanka.

Default currency: Sri Lankan Rupee (LKR / Rs.).

Design the system so additional currencies and future features can be introduced without major architectural changes.

